        "line": 293,
        "text": "theorem copySolve_deck (k n : Frequency) (p : P) (hp : PeriodicAt d.source p) (Y : Plane) :\n    d.copySolve g hab (k + coverIndex g.gap n) (p, Y + TorusAverages.latticePoint n) =\n      d.copySolve g hab k (p, Y)"
